- Apply only when `PROJECT.md` enables `localization`; otherwise treat locale edits as out of scope unless the human explicitly requests them.
- Prefer existing key namespaces and interpolation patterns; do not invent parallel translation systems.
- Consult `docs/ai/manual-localization.md` for direction, formatting, and verification expectations.
